func add_claim_rule
  ret "To add a claim: declare the attribute in `src/AppHost/realms/realm.json`'s user profile (`kc.user.profile.config`, `\"edit\": [\"admin\"]`), add an `oidc-usermodel-attribute-mapper` for it to the `<name>-web` client, and give local users a value under `attributes`."
end
